{
 "sweep_id": "check_laptop_hdbscan",
 "description": "The laptop-to-GPU check (TESTING.md): the template's version of tests/laptop_standin.py, the hdbscan package's HDBSCAN with the script's settings on the stand-in sample's f columns, unscaled, on every row. Its labels (assignments.csv) should match the script's on the CPU exactly.",
 "purpose": "learning",
 "follows": [],
